'' SELECT CASE AS CONST over constants the subject holds lowers to ONE switch terminator,
'' every value of a range and every alternative listed, CASE ELSE as its default. A value
'' outside the subject's range (300 over a ubyte) keeps the compare chain, which compares in
'' the promoted type as fbc does.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/mir/src/select-const-switch.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: switch %
'' EXPECT-OUT: 65: sel.body
'' EXPECT-OUT: 67: sel.body
'' EXPECT-OUT: 71: sel.body
'' EXPECT-OUT: condbr
'' EXPECT-OUT: verify: ok
